  "details": "Easiest steps to replicate\n\n1. Have a power power plan set to turn the display off after one minute.\n\n2. Run the game in the foreground (active window).\n\nThe behaviour on live has always been that the game will continue to run and the screen will continue to stay on.\n\nThe behaviour on beta is that the screen now turns off. This is undesirable, because I don't consider my PC to be inactive if VRChat is running and active as the foreground window.",
